{"pageProps":{"data":{"news_id":"703","news_catgory":"0","hot_news":"0","news_push":"","news_on_top":"1","news_title":"印尼禁售無棕櫚油食品 保護雨林政策受質疑","news_summary":"","image_path":"","news_content":"<p initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, \\\"><span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">2019-08-29 21:22</span><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">中央社 雅加達<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">29</span>日專電</span></p>\n\n<p initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, \\\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, \\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14pt;\\\">印尼新都將落腳東加里曼丹省，外界擔心開發對熱帶雨林帶來破壞。印尼近期下令食品標示不得標榜「無棕櫚油」否則下架，被質疑是為保護破壞熱帶雨林元兇之一的棕櫚油產業。</span></p>\n\n<p initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, \\\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, \\\"><span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14pt;\\\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14pt;\\\">印尼與馬來西亞是世界兩大棕櫚油產地。繼馬來西亞之後，印尼食品藥物管理局（<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">BPOM</span>）在<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">8</span>月<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">21</span>日宣布，禁止食品標示「無棕櫚油」，理由是這個標示會讓民眾誤以為「不含棕櫚油」的食品是比較健康的。</span></p>\n\n<p initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, \\\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, \\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14pt;\\\">路透社（<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">Reuters</span>）在<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">23</span>日引述貿易部官員的談話報導，<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">BPOM</span>發布公告後，貿易部已經在<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">10</span>餘個位於雅加達的超市稽查，確保架上食品的包裝都沒有標榜「無棕櫚油」。</span></p>\n\n<p initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, \\\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, \\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14pt;\\\">印尼環保新聞網站<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">Mongabay</span>近日報導，這項禁令受到印尼棕櫚油業委員會（<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">DMSI</span>）歡迎。<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">DMSI</span>主席戴羅姆（<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">Derom Bangun</span>）指出，外界指棕櫚油業破壞環境、危害健康，這是抹黑，這項禁令可反駁這種不公平的指控。</span></p>\n\n<p initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, \\\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, \\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14pt;\\\">戴羅姆指出，印尼在<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">2011</span>年建立核發永續棕櫚油認證制度，藉此要求棕櫚油業者負起環保與社會責任，此後業者就沒有為了種植棕櫚樹再砍伐熱帶雨林。</span></p>\n\n<p initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, \\\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, \\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14pt;\\\">不過，<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">Mongabay</span>的報導引述今年<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">2</span>月由美國杜克大學發表的研究報告指出，在<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">2008</span>年至<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">2010</span>年間，<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">57%</span>的熱帶雨林遭到砍伐都是因為要改種棕櫚樹；即使在<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">2014</span>年至<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">2016</span>年間，聖嬰現象引發乾旱及森林火災也是破壞雨林的主因，仍有<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">25%</span>的林地面積減少是因為改種棕櫚樹所致。</span></p>\n\n<p initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, \\\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, \\\"><span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14pt;\\\">Mongabay</span><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14pt;\\\">指出，關於棕櫚油對健康的影響，科學文獻有不同的研究結果。而根據去年<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">7</span>月發表在「世界衛生組織公告」（<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">WHO Bulletin</span>）的研究文章，這主要是因為很多科學文獻是由棕櫚油產業遊說團體所產出的。</span></p>\n\n<p initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, \\\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, \\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14pt;\\\">為了保護紅毛猩猩的熱帶雨林棲息地，國際環保人士<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">2017</span>年在澳洲推出國際化的「無棕櫚油認證計畫」（<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">POFCAP</span>），已獲得<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">19</span>個國家與地區承認，除了澳洲、紐西蘭、美國、英國等歐洲國家，在亞洲只有印度與新加坡。</span></p>\n\n<p initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, \\\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, \\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14pt;\\\">根據新聞網站<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">Bakeryandsnacks.com</span>報導，獲得<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">POFCAP</span>的產品共千餘項，有植物油、點心、護膚產品及維他命等。</span><span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14pt;\\\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n\n<p initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, \\\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, \\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14pt;\\\">據報導，棕櫚油產業是印尼主要的外匯來源之一，在<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">2017</span>年對印尼的<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">GDP</span>貢獻<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">2.46%</span>，主要的出口對象是印度、中國與歐盟。印尼有約<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">200</span>萬人受僱棕櫚油產業。</span><span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14pt;\\\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n\n<p initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, \\\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, \\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14pt;\\\">今年<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">3</span>月歐盟決定逐步減少將棕櫚油當作生質燃料使用，直到<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">2030</span>年前全面停止，因為東南亞國家砍伐雨林以生產棕櫚油，並非永續使用資源的方式。</span><span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14pt;\\\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n\n<p initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, \\\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, \\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14pt;\\\">印尼與馬來西亞多次向歐盟抗議，印尼還威脅要退出遏止全球暖化的巴黎協定（<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">Paris Agreement</span>）。</span></p>\n\n<p initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, \\\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, \\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">資料來源<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">:</span></span><span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">https://udn.com/news/story/6812/4018116</span></p>\n","keyword":"","news_order_id":"0","create_date":"2019-08-30","clk_count":"243"}},"__N_SSG":true}